<h1>Pulphouse</h1>

<a name="PULPH1">
<h2>Pulphouse: The Hardback Magazine</h2>
A magazine which was generally printed quarterly, always in hardcover. Most
of the issues were devoted to specific sub-genres such as Horror, Science
Fiction, Dark Fantasy, or Speculative Fiction. The series was edited
by Kristine Kathryn Rusch and published by Dean Wesley Smith.
