<a name="PULPH2">
<h2>Pulphouse: A Weekly Magazine</h2>
This form of <i>Pulphouse</i> appeared in a more traditional magazine
format, although it never published a "weekly" issue. After 5 issues, the
title was changed to the less strenuous <i>Pulphouse: A Fiction Magazine</i>.
The magzine was editied by Dean Wesley Smith.
